            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# wisp 1.1.1

## 🐞 Bug fixes

- Fixed the Settings sidebar on macOS 27: the selected item was
  unreadable (white text on a light background). Selection is now
  always legible in light and dark mode.
- Fixed Settings sidebar rows only responding when clicking exactly
  on the text — the whole row is clickable again.
]]></description>
